713">you </span><span begin="01:41.713" end="01:41.890">get </span><span begin="01:41.890" end="01:42.714">older</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.714" end="01:45.780"><span begin="01:42.714" end="01:42.913">Your </span><span begin="01:42.913" end="01:43.231">wild </span><span begin="01:43.231" end="01:43.736">heart </span><span begin="01:43.736" end="01:43.936">will </span><span begin="01:43.936" end="01:44.093">live </span><span begin="01:44.093" end="01:44.310">for </span><span begin="01:44.310" end="01:44.740">younger </span><span begin="01:44.740" end="01:45.516">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.780" end="01:48.891"><span begin="01:45.780" end="01:45.963">Think </span><span begin="01:45.963" end="01:46.147">of </span><span begin="01:46.147" end="01:46.533">me </span><span begin="01:46.533" end="01:46.781">if </span><span begin="01:46.781" end="01:47.133">ever </span><span begin="01:47.133" end="01:47.629">you're </span><span begin="01:47.629" end="01:48.661">afraid</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.891" end="01:52.612"><span begin="01:48.891" end="01:49.091">He </span><span begin="01:49.091" end="01:49.267">said </span><span begin="01:49.267" end="01:49.523">one </span><span begin="01:49.523" end="01:50.299">day </span><span begin="01:50.299" end="01:50.491">you'll </span><span begin="01:50.491" end="01:50.780">leave </span><span begin="01:50.780" end="01:50.979">this </span><span begin="01:50.979" end="01:51.262">world </span><span begin="01:51.262" end="01:52.284">behind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.612" end="01:56.476"><span begin="01:52.612" end="01:52.811">So </span><span begin="01:52.811" end="01:53.020">live </span><span begin="01:53.020" end="01:53.276">a </span><span begin="01:53.276" end="01:54.004">life </span><span begin="01:54.004" end="01:54.188">you </span><span begin="01:54.188" end="01:54.979">will </span><span begin="01:54.979" end="01:56.333">remember</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.476" end="02